+
+| Href | Role |
+|------|------|
+| `/loyalty/campaigns` | Cards + kebab + New + resume agent |
+| `/loyalty/campaigns/new` | Journey Builder + `AgentChat` rail |
+| `/loyalty/campaigns/[id]?campaignStatus=` | **Wizard edit**. Query is required to fetch the status partition |
+| `/loyalty/campaigns/[id]/agent` | Live-only agent rail |
